   "en": "Mugen no Skill Getter!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "無限のスキルゲッター！"
   },
   {
    "en": "Limitless Skill Getter!"
   },
   {
    "en": "Infinite Skill Getter!"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "During a Once-in-a-lifetime ceremony, the young boy, Yuri, receives the trash skill \"Life transfer\", allowing him to transfer his life force to another person...\n\nCrushed by despair after receiving the skill, Yuri encounters a woman who loses her life right in front of him. Wanting to be the one to decide who he gives his life to, he activates \"Life Transfer\", dying on the spot. It had appeared as though the woman's life was ended rather abruptly, however, the woman turned out to be the daughter of god. As a \"thank you\" for saving the life of his daughter, god resurrected Yuri, and in addition, gave him the ability to receive double the experience points each month. With the endless amount of experience he gains, Yuri will leisurely walk the path to the world's strongest, collecting endless amounts of skills along the way!\n___\n[Original web novel](https://www.alphapolis.co.jp/novel/587737999/279349914)",
   "ja": "一生に一度のスキルを授かる儀式で、ユーリが得たのは自分の命を他者に渡せる『生命譲渡』という超微妙なスキル。絶望に打ちひしがれるユーリは女性が目の前で命を落とす場面に遭遇。放っておけず『生命譲渡』を発動し絶命する…。しかし、その女性は神様の娘で、娘を救ってくれた礼にと神様はユーリを復活させ、おまけに経験値を毎月倍々で与えてくれることに。無限に経験値を得られるようになり、人生が一変したユーリが進む道は……!?"
  },
